### Find all content
GET http://localhost:8080/api/content

### Get content by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/content/1

### Create new content (id must be null; the server sets dateCreated)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": null,
  "title": "My third blog post",
  "desc": "My newest blog for the team",
  "status": "IDEA",
  "contentType": "ARTICLE",
  "dateCreated": null,
  "dateUpdated": null,
  "url": ""
}

### Update existing content (the path id wins)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/content/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "MY FIRST POST!!!",
  "desc": "MY FIRST POST!!!",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "contentType": "ARTICLE",
  "dateCreated": null,
  "dateUpdated": null,
  "url": "http://localhost:8080/my-first-blog-post"
}

### Update with an id that does not exist -> 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/content/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 99,
  "title": "Nope",
  "desc": "Nope",
  "status": "IDEA",
  "contentType": "ARTICLE",
  "dateCreated": null,
  "dateUpdated": null,
  "url": ""
}

### Search by title keyword
GET http://localhost:8080/api/content/filter/spring

### List by status (IDEA, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, PUBLISHED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/content/filter/status/IDEA

### Delete by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/content/1